&lt;p style="margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left; text-indent: 18px"&gt;Teijin Automotive Technologies, Inc.の持分に対し&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left; text-indent: 18px"&gt;1米ドル&lt;/p&gt;
